<title>MALAYSIA: Repco says in deal for timber division.</title>
<headline>Repco says in deal for timber division.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Repco Holdings Bhd said on Tuesday it was in the final stages of a deal concerning its timber division.</p>
<p>In a statement to the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange, Repco said further details of the agreement would be announced after the finalisation of the terms and conditions.</p>
<p>But, it did not say if it was selling the division or acquiring something.</p>
<p>Repco's shares were suspended from trading on June 10.</p>
<p>Repco shares closed 2.50 ringgit higher at 128.50 on June 9.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
